    {
      "id": "connector-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 56,
      "y": 230,
      "width": 368,
      "height": 22,
      "text": "GenericConnector  (one tokio task per PLC)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#5c5f66",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "roughness": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "connector-body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 56,
      "y": 256,
      "width": 368,
      "height": 154,
      "text": "connect()  →  exponential backoff retry\nbrowse()   →  populate node_reads list\n              update DiscoveredState map\n\nloop every tick_ms:\n  drain write_rx  (wires + setpoints)\n  →  session.write() each WriteCmd\n  poll()  →  session.read() all nodes\n  reconnect + re-browse on failure",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "roughness": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "listen-box",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 480,
      "y": 220,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 130,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#dbe4ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 }
    },
    {
      "id": "listen-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 496,
      "y": 230,
      "width": 348,
      "height": 22,
      "text": "Postgres LISTEN loop",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "roughness": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "listen-body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 496,
      "y": 256,
      "width": 348,
      "height": 84,
      "text": "LISTEN plant_changed\nON NOTIFY:\n  → atomically swap wire table\n  → start connectors for new PLCs\nTriggers on: plcs · device_instances · wires",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "roughness": 0
    },
